    "description": "<p>If you use a classic poker deck, the recommended suit types are: <strong>air</strong> (@ICON[diamond]), <strong>earth</strong> (@ICON[club]), <strong>fire</strong> (@ICON[heart]), and <strong>ice</strong> (@ICON[spade]).</p><hr><p><em><strong>Note</strong>: effects <strong>Blinding Flush</strong>, <strong>Double Trouble</strong>, and <strong>Magic Flush</strong> deal 10 extra damage if you are <strong>level 20 or higher</strong>, or 20 extra damage if you are level <strong>40 or higher.</strong></em></p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Jackpot</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>4 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value</strong>, <strong>none</strong> of which is a <strong>joker</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Any Player Character who has <strong>surrendered</strong> but is still narratively present on the scene regains consciousness (this does not cancel the effects of their <strong>Surrender</strong>); then, you and every ally you can see recover 777 Hit Points and 777 Mind Points.</p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Magic Flush</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>4 cards</strong> of <strong>consecutive values</strong> and of the <strong>same suit.</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>You deal damage equal to <strong>【25 + the total value of the resolved cards】</strong> to every enemy you can see. The type of this damage matches the <strong>suit</strong> of the resolved cards.</p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Blinding Flush</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>4 cards</strong> of <strong>consecutive values</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>You deal damage equal to <strong>【15 + the total value of the resolved cards】</strong> to every enemy you can see. The type of this damage is <strong>light</strong> if the highest value among those cards is <strong>even</strong>, or <strong>dark</strong> if that value is <strong>odd.</strong></p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Full Status</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>3 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value</strong> + <strong>2 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value.</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Choose <strong>two</strong> status effects among <strong>dazed</strong>, <strong>shaken</strong>, <strong>slow</strong>, and <strong>weak</strong>: if <strong>【the highest value among resolved cards】</strong> is <strong>even</strong>, you and every ally you can see recover from the chosen status effects; if <strong>odd</strong>, every enemy you can see suffers them.</p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Triple Support</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>3 cards</strong> of <strong>the same value</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>You and every ally you can see recover an amount of Hit Points equal to <strong>【the total value of the resolved cards, multiplied by 3】</strong>.</p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Double Trouble</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>2 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value + 2 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>You deal damage equal to <strong>【10 + the highest value among resolved cards】</strong> to each of <strong>up to two</strong> different enemies you can see. The type of this damage is one of your choice among those matching the <strong>suits</strong> of the resolved cards.</p><table style=\"height:34px;width:100%;border-width:1px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:27.9452%\"></col><col style=\"width:72.0548%\"></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Effect</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Set Requirements</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"height:17px\"><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>Magic Pair</strong></td><td style=\"height:17px;border-width:1px\"><strong>2 cards</strong> of the <strong>same value</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>You perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with a weapon you have equipped. If this attack deals damage, choose a <strong>suit</strong> among those of the resolved cards; all damage dealt by the attack becomes of the type matching that <strong>suit</strong>.</p>",
